        "text": "Base rate / reference class: the relevant reference class is recent first prints of the same Eurostat euro area SA total unemployment rate. The one-decimal series moved from 6.1 to 6.4 over January-July, but every adjacent first-print change was between -0.1 and +0.1 percentage point, so last-print persistence is the base rate model."
